# The control panel: transport, stepping, shortcuts, sliders. Expects the default start-up
# (single rotation, a blob in the middle, 256×256).
wait 25; expect_gen 0; expect_playing off
shot controls-1-start

# The size menu: the grid grows and shrinks around the pattern, which stays in the middle.
# What no longer fits is cut off: here a cell far from the blob.
paint 10 20
click GridSize; wait 4; shot controls-2-sizes
click GridSize:512; wait 4; expect_size 512 512; expect_population 1211; expect_cell 138 148 on
click GridSize; wait 4; click GridSize:64; wait 4; expect_size 64 64; expect_population 1210
shot controls-3-small-grid
click GridSize; wait 4; click GridSize:256; wait 4; expect_size 256 256; expect_cell 10 20 off

# Play and pause, by button and by key.
click PlayPause; wait 6; expect_playing on
key Space; wait 3; expect_playing off

# Stepping: a tap is one frame, shift makes it a single generation.
clear
key ArrowRight; wait 2; expect_gen 1
key ArrowLeft; wait 2; expect_gen 0
stride 5
click StepForward; wait 2; expect_gen 5
press Shift; key ArrowRight; release Shift; wait 2; expect_gen 6
click StepBack; wait 2; expect_gen 1
stride 1; clear

# Shortcuts take no modifier: Ctrl+C is not "c".
paint 5 5
key Ctrl+c; wait 2; expect_cell 5 5 on
key c; wait 2; expect_cell 5 5 off

# Sliders: the wheel steps to the next value, the keys nudge.
scroll Stride 3; expect_stride 4
scroll Stride -5; expect_stride 1
key .; key .; wait 2; expect_stride 3
key ,; wait 2; expect_stride 2
stride 1
key [; wait 2; expect_speed 15
scroll Speed -1; wait 2
key ]; wait 2
shot controls-4-sliders

# Checkboxes follow their option, whoever changes it.
expect_checked Reverse off; click Reverse; wait 3; expect_checked Reverse on
key r; wait 3; expect_checked Reverse off
expect_checked ShowGrid on; key g; wait 3; expect_checked ShowGrid off; click ShowGrid; wait 3; expect_checked ShowGrid on

# The view: the wheel zooms about the pointer, right-drag pans, a click paints under the pointer.
# Fitted, 256 cells take 0.94 of the 900 px height; two notches zoom in by 1.44.
clear; fit; wait 2
scroll Grid 2; wait 2; click Grid; wait 2; expect_cell 128 128 on
drag Grid 33 0 right; wait 2; click Grid; wait 2; expect_cell 121 128 on
key f; wait 2; shot controls-5-view

# The fastest setting must leave the window responsive: these 30 frames take half a second.
blob; speed 240; stride 512; play; wait 30; shot controls-6-flat-out
pause; wait 2; expect_playing off

# A cloud: as dense as the slider says in the middle, thinning out, generation 0 again.
click Cloud; wait 3; expect_gen 0; shot controls-7-cloud
quit
